  "body": "IDL:\n\n```\nCanvasPattern createPattern(CanvasImageSource image, [TreatNullAs=EmptyString] DOMString repetition);\n```\n\nProse at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#dom-context-2d-createpattern step 2:\n\n> Check the usability of the image argument. If this returns aborted, then an exception has been thrown and the method doesn't return anything; abort these steps. If it returns bad, then return null and abort these steps. \n",
